+# A steward flags a person with a reason until a date, replacing any flag they had. While the sheet's today is on or before
+# the until date only a steward may open the person's claims. A refused flag (no signed-in user, a blank reason, a bad date,
+# a user who is not a steward, unknown person) writes nothing, not even an audit line.
